      "bbox": [
        313.2,
        242,
        576,
        284
      ],
      "text": "\u0007state law may protect you from liability for the unpaid balance. If you refinance or take on any additional debt on this property, you may lose this protection and have to pay any debt remaining even after foreclosure. You may want to consult a lawyer for more information. x"
    },
